            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Bengali for to breathe a sigh of relief, then the Bengali for to cope with."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: আফসোস",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আফসোস — āphsos — \"regret; a pity\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ছুটিতে গ্রামে যেতে পারলাম না, এটাই আমার আফসোস। chhuṭite grāme jete pārlām nā, eṭāi āmār āphsos. I couldn't go to the village for the holidays, and that is my one regret."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আফসোস (āphsos) করা, to say you regret something; আফসোস (āphsos) হওয়া, to feel regret."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আফসোস (āphsos) is usually traced to Persian afsōs, a cry of \"alas\" that also means regret."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
